1
00:00:00,785 --> 00:00:02,165
(Sheldon:)I question your premise.

2
00:00:02,328 --> 00:00:05,248
(Sheldon:)How is a new suit going to prevent me
from passing out...

3
00:00:05,414 --> 00:00:07,374
(Sheldon:)...in front of a ballroom
full of people?

4
00:00:07,541 --> 00:00:08,751
(Penny:)It'll give you confidence.

5
00:00:08,918 --> 00:00:10,918
(Penny:)Sometimes when I'm feeling
stressed out...

6
00:00:11,087 --> 00:00:13,757
(Penny:)...I go out and buy a cute top
or a fun skirt...

7
00:00:13,923 --> 00:00:16,053
(Penny:)...and I have a whole new outlook
on life.

8
00:00:16,592 --> 00:00:19,762
(Sheldon:)Don't you eventually realize
you're the same stressed-out person...

9
00:00:19,929 --> 00:00:21,929
(Sheldon:)...in a cute top or a fun skirt?

10
00:00:22,890 --> 00:00:24,520
(Penny:)Yeah, that's when I buy shoes.

11
00:00:25,935 --> 00:00:27,645
Now, let's see what we got.

12
00:00:27,812 --> 00:00:30,942
Oh. This is nice.

13
00:00:31,107 --> 00:00:33,777
It's only one color.

14
00:00:33,943 --> 00:00:35,233
Yes, so?

15
00:00:35,778 --> 00:00:38,368
(Sheldon:)That's a lot of money
for only one color.

16
00:00:39,281 --> 00:00:41,821
(Penny:)Fine. Why don't you pick out
what you like?

17
00:00:42,952 --> 00:00:44,622
(Sheldon:)Hmm.

18
00:00:45,413 --> 00:00:53,023
SHELDON:
This is pretty sharp.

